                <pb facs="0280" n="230" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg230"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Runyon to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-10-28"><hi rendition="#italic">October 28,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Telegram received this morning. I have seen minister for foreign affairs and made
                    urgent representations according to instructions. Immediate action or reply not
                    probable on account of present Government conditions.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
